{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21123","headline":"画松 · 元稹","name":"画松","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"张璪画古松，往往得神骨。\n翠帚扫春风，枯龙戛寒月。\n流传画师辈，奇态尽埋没。\n纤枝无萧洒，顽干空突兀。\n乃悟埃尘心，难状烟霄质。\n我去淅阳山，深山看真物。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"元稹","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_21123.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21123","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}